							},
							"string" : "Properties of a class declared inside a function body (local classes, object expressions) become `FAMIXLocalVariable`s of the enclosing method instead of attributes of the local class. Cause: {{gtMethod:GtSmaCCKotlinClassPartsImporter>>visitClassDeclaration:}} switches `currentContainer` but keeps `currentMethod`. Fix: save `currentMethod`, set it to nil while visiting the class, then restore it."
						},
