							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Locals in code bodies other than functions probably become `FAMIXAttribute`s of the class: `init { val tmp = … }`, secondary constructor bodies, getter/setter bodies (`get() { val t = … }`), and lambdas in property initializers (`val x = run { val y = 1; y }`). {{gtClass:GtSmaCCKotlinClassPartsImporter}} only sets `currentMethod` for a `KotlinFunctionDeclarationNode`. Found by reading the code, not confirmed by an example yet. Java references: `ensureInitializerFrom:`, `ensureConstructorFrom:`, `ensureLambdaFrom:` in {{gtClass:GtSmaCCJavaImporter}}. Thinnest first case: `init`."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
