							},
							"string" : "Refactoring candidate: import classes with a visitor too. {{gtMethod:GtSmaCCKotlinImporter>>importClasses}} still uses `withAllNodesOfType:`, {{gtMethod:GtSmaCCKotlinImporter>>containerIn:}} and the `#container` node attribute, and every `ensure…From:in:` finds its file via `topParent attributeNamed: #famixFile` (a visitor could track `currentFile`). Caveat: classes from all files must exist before any declared type is looked up, so class creation stays a separate pass before class parts."
